  <!-- EN: subjects -->
  <VFEM2_KingdomRough.pawnsPlural>臣民</VFEM2_KingdomRough.pawnsPlural>
  
  <!-- EN: savage kingdom -->
  <VFEM2_KingdomSavage.label>残暴的国度</VFEM2_KingdomSavage.label>
  <!-- EN: These people have been here for a shorter period of time than their neolithic bretheren. It is believed that some tribespeople and outlanders had come to embrace the medieval ways of life and decided to unite.\n\nThough still technologically inferior to many other factions, the subjects of this kingdom are well-known for using towering fortifications to protect their assets, as well as adopting the use of shields in combat and fighting in a particularly orderly manner.\n\nThis particular kingdom is driven by a warband styled culture; you will not be able to ally with them! -->
  <VFEM2_KingdomSavage.description>这些人比起部落民来看更加发达。据说他们大多来自部落和外来者，形成了一种类似中世纪的封建社会存续了下来。\n\n虽说比起其它派系，他们的科技并不怎么发达，但是十分擅长建造城堡工事来保卫自己的领土，以及热爱磨练自己的武艺。\n\n这个国度极端排外、充斥着血与荣耀的文化，你和他们永远都不会成为朋友。</VFEM2_KingdomSavage.description>
  <!-- EN: king -->
  <VFEM2_KingdomSavage.leaderTitle>国王</VFEM2_KingdomSavage.leaderTitle>
